My constraint is wrong too. It is missing a negative sign and is more complicated. You probably need to define a function that returns the lower bound depending on which of the three cases applies here

http://www.wolframalpha.com/input/?i=solve+Max%5B-1,+-u+*+(1+-+d)+%2F+4%5D+%3C+d+for+d

where u = max(exp(X * beta)).

Ben

